WEBVTT

00:22:28.871 --> 00:22:32.371
This is the first of three important steps
organizations can take to prevent

00:22:32.371 --> 00:22:35.788
escalation of commitment, separate
the decision from

00:22:35.788 --> 00:22:37.204
the initial decision maker.

00:22:38.621 --> 00:22:40.871
There's an organization that
does exactly this,

00:22:41.579 --> 00:22:45.163
its acts also known as Google's
Moonshot Factory,

00:22:46.038 --> 00:22:47.996
it's where inventors and
entrepreneurs build

00:22:47.996 --> 00:22:50.621
and launch new projects that
seem out of this world,

00:22:51.079 --> 00:22:55.204
like self-driving cars and balloons,
beaming Internet to remote communities.

00:22:55.704 --> 00:22:59.496
My name is Cathy Qanoon and I was
formerly a rapid evaluator at

00:22:59.496 --> 00:23:02.413
X Rapid Evaluator. Is that a job?